Feral Spirits Follow
    Events
        Time - Every 2.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in FeralSpirits_WolfGroup and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_TempWolf = (Picked unit)
                Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_WolfCV = (Custom value of FeralSpirits_TempWolf)
                Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_TempSummoner = FeralSpirits_Summoner[FeralSpirits_WolfCV]
                Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_TempPoint = (Position of FeralSpirits_TempSummoner)
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (FeralSpirits_TempSummoner is alive) Equal to True
                        (FeralSpirits_TempWolf is alive) Equal to True
                        (Distance between (Position of FeralSpirits_TempWolf) and FeralSpirits_TempPoint) Greater than 600.00
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Order FeralSpirits_TempWolf to Right-Click FeralSpirits_TempSummoner
                    Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (Current order of FeralSpirits_TempSummoner) Equal to (Order(attack))
                                (Current order of FeralSpirits_TempWolf) Not equal to (Order(smart))
                            Then - Actions
                                Unit - Order FeralSpirits_TempWolf to Right-Click FeralSpirits_TempSummoner
                            Else - Actions
                                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                                    If - Conditions
                                        (Current order of FeralSpirits_TempWolf) Not equal to (Order(smart))
                                    Then - Actions
                                        Unit - Order FeralSpirits_TempWolf to Right-Click FeralSpirits_TempSummoner
                                    Else - Actions
                -------- Remove LEAKS --------
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_FeralSpirits_TempPoint)
        -------- ===================================== --------
